WEBVTT

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:03.096
They made beautiful handmade products.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.056
And when I met them and I saw their work,

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.080
I decided I wanted to help.

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:12.176
With some friends,
I cofounded a social enterprise

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.016
with the mission to help the women
create an income stream

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:18.280
and improve their quality of life.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.856
We did everything by the book,

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.496
as we had learned in business school.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.936
We got investors,

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:31.616
we spent a lot of time building
the business and training the women.